EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

I recently called you but wanted to also reach out by email. My name is {!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}, and I am your personal admission counselor at Arizona State University.

Thank you for taking the time to visit ASU. I hope you enjoyed your campus tour. I would love to hear back from you to find out what you enjoyed most about your visit.

Your next step is to apply to ASU (http://students.asu.edu/apply). If you aren’t quite sure which major is right for you, use our degree search tool at http://asu.edu/degrees to find majors that interest you based on keyword, campus or college. You can also compare degrees side-by-side to review admission criteria, get a sense of what each major is about, and find out about jobs and salaries earned with each degree.

If you have any questions, please do not hesitate to ask.

{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}
Admission Services
{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}


If you would like any additional information or have questions related to this subject, please reply to this email.

{!Case.Thread_Id}
